					<p>Having experience as the first designer for various early stage startups, I've built products from the ground up, led rebrands, and been responsible for every part of the user journey, from product design and marketing to front-end development. I take a holistic, big picture approach to design, ensuring a consistent user experience from start to finish.</p>
				</div>
		  </div>

		  <div class="row mb-0 row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-3 justify-content-md-center">
